  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the resilience of smallholder farmers in Southern Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to prevent the deterioration of the humanitarian context, through interventions to sustainably improve access to seeds of drought-tolerant varieties, capacity building of communities on agricultural practices resilient to climate change and the diversification of household income sources in order to improve their coping mechanisms to shocks and stabilize their food and nutritional security.</narrative>
  </description>
